# TobyVerse mindset

Source of truth: `docs/mindset.md`.

When changing chat/notes prompts or “voice”:
- Read `docs/mindset.md` first.
- Small quality edits are allowed.
- Do not violate its invariants (request comes first; no forced lesson/story/table/quiz).
- Keep global voice in `ASK_WRITING_CONTRACT`. Path teaching rituals stay in path lead/briefing only.
- After a philosophy change, update `docs/mindset.md` and then the runtime strings so they still match.
